<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Center</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>center
</pre>
<p>Takes you into your clan house, past its locked door. Type it in the room 
in front of your clan's door; it works only there, and only for members of 
that clan. To others the door stays locked. To go out again, see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Cexit</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cexit</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Commands</a>
</pre>




</div>